type CAPA = {
  id: string;
  evidence: string[];
  lineage: string;
  owners: string[];
  status: 'detect'|'contain'|'remediate'|'verify';
}
function createCAPA(req, res) { /* ... */ }
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you automate evidence collection across tenants?
- How would you validate long-term containment after rollout?

